               absolutely_integrable_on (UNIONS u) /\
               integral (UNIONS u) (\x. abs(det(matrix(g' x))) % f(g x)) = b <=>
               f absolutely_integrable_on (IMAGE g (UNIONS u)) /\
               integral (IMAGE g (UNIONS u)) f = b)"
